      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How repeatable is that? I wonder what the debug robot would show for coordinates.\n\nWhat world I'll try and check it out tonight. My suspicion is that the avatar was thrown very far from the origin. About 8km away from 0,0,0 the interface gets a little bouncy.\n\nI believe \"Test Pilots\" world has a space elevator in a nearby city, and visiting the top of it, the interface should noticably shake.\n\nBasically the accuracy of the floating point numbers is off that far away.",
