      "value": "@{62df7cd83e007e467295c4e1|full_name}:It was on \"Aircraft Carrier Jets: F-14\"\n\nI guess it can be repeatable because it happened after jet exploding when I was inside it. Usually player is sent to wherever is the direction he's flying to with jets speed but this time i was still on carrier so I guess it just sent me to the moon cuz i was not flying at any direction and expolsion just bugged somehow. \n\nI guess just a fix for menu shaking  would be enough so player can at least respawn.",
